        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheWorldAvatar/ontoclimateadapt/main/OntoClimateAdapt.owl#TopsoilWaterContent"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Relates a Location to the TopsoilWaterContent observed at that location.</rdfs:comment>
